cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "JSVisualizer: Interactive JavaScript Execution Visualizer"
abstract: >
  An educational web application that interactively visualizes JavaScript
  program execution. Built on JSInterpreter's JSDebugger API, it provides
  step execution at expression, statement, human-friendly, and function-call
  granularities, with 16 visualization views including trace tables,
  recursion trees, memory models, and substitution-model displays.
authors:
